<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Appendix D Fine-tuning Details ‣ Disentangling Interaction and Bias Effects in Opinion Dynamics of Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Training Configuration</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In Appendix D Fine-tuning Details ‣ Disentangling Interaction and Bias Effects in Opinion Dynamics of Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Evaluation</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
